<view class="page-shell sub-page" style="{{statusBarStyle}}">
  <view class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack" aria-label="返回"><image class="nav-back-icon" src="/assets/ui/v4/back-strong.svg" /></view>
  <text class="eyebrow">授权与隐私</text>
  <text class="page-title">隐私授权</text>
  <text class="page-lede">每一项都单独授权，也都可以随时收回。</text>
  <text wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-text">正在读取授权状态…</text>
  <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-text">{{error}}</text>

  <text class="group-label">原始语音</text>
  <view class="card privacy-card">
    <view class="privacy-head">
      <mp-icon name="wave" tone="ink"></mp-icon>
      <view class="row-copy">
        <text class="setting-name">原始语音归档</text>
        <text class="setting-desc">{{consent ? consentLabel : '默认关闭'}}</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{consent ? true : false}}" color="#4A52C9" disabled="{{!configOpen}}" bindchange="onRawAudioSwitch" aria-label="原始语音归档" />
    </view>
    <text class="privacy-copy">开启后，机器人对话的原始语音会保存在你的账号下，直到你撤回授权。撤回时服务端会删除这些录音。</text>
    <text wx:if="{{!configOpen}}" class="privacy-copy">{{configNote}}</text>
    <view class="privacy-foot">
      <button wx:if="{{!consent}}" class="primary-button" loading="{{acting}}" disabled="{{!configOpen}}" bindtap="grant">明确授权原始语音归档</button>
      <button wx:else class="danger-link" disabled="{{!configOpen}}" bindtap="revoke">撤回并删除录音</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <text class="group-label">长期记忆</text>
  <view class="list">
    <view class="list-row" bindtap="openChildMemory">
      <mp-icon name="note" tone="ink"></mp-icon>
      <view class="row-copy">
        <text class="row-title">孩子的长期记忆</text>
        <text class="row-meta">只记称呼、兴趣和小名，在「孩子的记忆」里开关</text>
      </view>
      <image class="row-chev" src="/assets/ui/v4/chev-faint.svg" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <text class="privacy-note">小程序只管理授权，不采集或中转实时音频。</text>
</view>
